---
import EditorialHero from '../components/EditorialHero.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | The Soft Nest Edit" description="How The Soft Nest Edit handles sign-in email addresses, saved products, optional newsletter preferences and website data.">
  <EditorialHero eyebrow="VISITOR INFORMATION" description="How we handle member information and support your privacy choices.">Privacy <em>policy.</em></EditorialHero>
  <div class="shell info-page">
    <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> November 22, 2026. <strong>Version:</strong> 2026-11-22.</p>
    <p>This notice explains how The Soft Nest Edit ("we", "us" or "our") processes information when you visit <a href="https://thesoftnestedit.online/">thesoftnestedit.online</a>, open an account, save products, or choose to receive optional email updates. Please also read our <a href="/terms/">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.</p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Account and member data:</strong> If you request a passwordless sign-in link, our authentication provider Supabase processes the email address you enter, a user ID, authentication/session data and security-related metadata. When signed in, we store your saved product identifiers in your account under that user ID.</p>
    <p><strong>Agreements and newsletter choices:</strong> We record the versions and dates of Terms acceptance and Privacy Policy acknowledgement after successful sign-in. If you independently opt in to our newsletter, we also store your preference, account identifier, verified email address and the dates the choice changes. A newsletter checkbox is optional and is off by default.</p>
    <p><strong>Technical data:</strong> Cloudflare and other technical providers may process IP addresses, browser/device information, request logs and security signals to provide the website and protect it against misuse. Browser storage can hold a Supabase login session, local saved products, a short-lived pending-save request, and a short-lived email/consent handoff needed when a sign-in link opens another tab.</p>
    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>We use this data to authenticate members, keep saved products available across their devices, maintain security, record requested account preferences, operate the website, respond to legitimate support requests, and meet applicable legal obligations. Account-related security emails are distinct from optional marketing emails.</p>
    <h2>Optional newsletters and withdrawal</h2>
    <p>You do not have to subscribe to a newsletter to sign in or save products. If you choose to subscribe, you may opt out by signing in and unchecking the newsletter preference in Account. We retain the date of an opt-out so future mailing systems can honor it. This website update does not itself send newsletters. Before any newsletters are sent, we must configure an email delivery provider, an unsubscribe mechanism, and any additional confirmations required by applicable law. Any provider added later will be identified here.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate links and third parties</h2>
    <p>Our articles and product pages may contain Amazon affiliate links. When you follow an outbound link, the retailer may collect information under its own privacy notice, including cookies and purchase details. We do not process payment details, shipping addresses or retail orders through this website. We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</p>
    <h2>Providers, transfers and security</h2>
    <p>Cloudflare provides hosting and delivery services; Supabase provides authentication and account data storage. These services may process data in countries other than yours. We use database row-level restrictions so signed-in users can access only their own saved items and account preferences through the public API. No online system is risk-free; if you suspect a problem with your account, contact us.</p>
    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>Account identifiers, saved items, and preferences generally remain while an account is active or until you ask us to erase them, subject to legitimate legal, security or operational retention needs. Temporary browser sign-in intent is intended to expire after approximately one hour; authentication tokens and service logs have provider-specific lifetimes. We will review the retention and deletion procedures when configuring a permanent business contact channel and newsletter service.</p>
    <h2>Your choices and requests</h2>
    <p>You may remove saved items, sign out, withdraw newsletter permission in Account, or ask us about access, correction or deletion of personal data. Rights vary by location; we will consider requests under applicable privacy laws and explain any limitations. Closing a browser tab does not necessarily delete your account or the data saved in Supabase.</p>
    <h2>Analytics and local storage</h2>
    <p>{site.webAnalyticsToken ? 'Cloudflare Web Analytics is configured on the Site; it helps us understand aggregated website visits and performance.' : 'Cloudflare Web Analytics is not enabled through the current site configuration. We will update this notice if this changes.'} Browser local storage supports saved-product continuity and authentication-related preferences. You can clear this storage through your browser, but doing so may sign you out or remove unsynced saves.</p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This is a general-interest home-decor website and is not designed to collect information from children. If you believe a child has provided account information to us without appropriate permission, please contact us.</p>
    <h2>Policy updates and contact</h2>
    <p>We will update this page if our practices change materially. For privacy requests, visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>{site.contactEmail && <> or email <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a></>}.</p>
  
    <!-- softnest-adsense-privacy -->
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>We are preparing to use Google AdSense to support our editorial content. Advertising is currently disabled on this website: no Google ad-display script is loaded by this integration. If advertising is enabled later, Google and its partners may process device information and use cookies or similar technologies to deliver and measure advertising, subject to applicable privacy and consent choices. Read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google&#39;s advertising information</a> for more details. We will review consent requirements before enabling advertising.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
